@baseUrl = http://localhost:8081
@ticketCategoryId = 2
@recordId = 1

### 0. 管理员登录
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "phone": "13800000002",
  "password": "Test123456"
}

> {%
  client.global.set("adminToken", response.body.data.token);
%}

### 1. 当前推荐：按票档预热 MySQL 库存到 Redis / Bucket
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/ticket-categories/{{ticketCategoryId}}/stock/preheat
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### 2. 查看库存总览
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/stocks
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### 3. 查询 Redis 可售库存
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/stocks/{{ticketCategoryId}}/redis
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### 4. 查询 Redis / MySQL 当前一致性视图
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/stocks/{{ticketCategoryId}}/consistency
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### 5. 主动执行单票档一致性检查
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/stocks/consistency/check/{{ticketCategoryId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### 6. 批量检查
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/stocks/consistency/check-all?batchSize=100
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### 7. 查询待处理差异记录
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/stocks/consistency-records?status=PENDING&limit=20
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### 8. 修复差异记录
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/stocks/consistency-records/{{recordId}}/repair
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### 9. 忽略差异记录
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/stocks/consistency-records/{{recordId}}/ignore
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### 10. 扫描并补偿 FAILED 异步请求的 Redis 预扣
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/stocks/failed-requests/compensate?batchSize=100
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### 说明
### /api/admin/stocks/{ticketCategoryId}/preload 仍是当前 Controller 能力，
### 但普通联调优先使用 /api/admin/ticket-categories/{id}/stock/preheat，避免两套预热入口在样例中并列。
